# NAVARIS — Business Intelligence OS

**I am the Seed. Agents are Peers. Like Torrent, but Intelligence.**

> Torrent distributes files. NAVARIS distributes intelligence.
> Torrent: Seed (file) → Peers → Leech → file downloaded.
> NAVARIS: Seed (Me - Capital - Books - Experience) → 6 Agents → Library → Score + OER + COUNTRY + Decision.

## Structured — 5 Layers

| Layer | Name | What |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 0 | **Capital Base** | Invested Capital + Capital Opinion — The Foundation |
| 1 | **Input Fields — Editable** | Sector, Type, Revenue, OPEX, CAPEX, Payment, Ratios, COUNTRY, Risk, TRUST — All Editable + Add |
| 2 | **Business Management Library** | Books • Modern References • Research Papers • Cases — Goal: Research & Development |
| 3 | **Autonomous Agents Engine** | FETCH → STORE → ANALYZE → DEVELOP → DECIDE → DELIVER — 24/7 |
| 4 | **Output** | Score • OER • ROI • Decision: GREEN INVEST / YELLOW Ask More / RED STOP |

